This project is derived from, and builds on, work by Reis Can (reisxd):
  - TizenBrewInstaller  https://github.com/reisxd/TizenBrewInstaller  (GPL-3.0)
      on-TV installation via the TV's own sdbd and vd_appinstall
  - TizenTube           https://github.com/reisxd/TizenTube           (GPL-3.0)
      DevTools-based userscript injection (apps/ytmod); the TizenTube
      userscript (@foxreis/tizentube) is bundled into the YT Mod package
  - tizen.js            https://github.com/reisxd/tizen.js            (GPL-3.0)
      package signing and Samsung certificate requests (used as an optional
      build-time dependency); packages/tizen-sign is an ES5 port of its
      Signature class, run on the TV

Thanks also to Apps2Samsung (https://github.com/Apps2Samsung/Apps2Samsung),
which showed that Samsung TVs need a Samsung-issued certificate listing the
TV's DUID. `npm run cert -- import` reuses the certificates it creates; no
Apps2Samsung code is included.

The SDB packet format follows the public Android Debug Bridge protocol.
